<p>4  Perilya Mines	   179.07    0.77</p>
<p>5  Syd Hrbr Casino	 145.95    2.16</p>
<p>6  Equatorial Min	  133.33    0.24</p>
<p>7  Westpac Prop Tr	 107.50    1.72</p>
<p>8  St Barbara Mine	  90.14    0.64</p>
<p>9  Tap Oil		    84.09    1.48</p>
<p>10 Consol Paper	     79.41    2.70</p>
<p>Lowest 10</p>
